Use the Service lawfully and fairly. Do not:

- break the law or the rights of others;
- try to get into accounts, systems or data that are not yours;
- overload or disrupt the Service, or get around rate limits, bot checks or other security measures;
- copy, resell or reverse engineer the Service, except where the law allows it;
- use the Service to send spam or harmful code.

We may limit or suspend access if you break these rules or put the Service or other people at risk. Where we can, we tell you why and give you a chance to fix the problem first.
